# Manifold level 10
# The gatehouse (stage 5n; rebuilt in 5o, decision 0031: levels of floors above floors). A hall of two
# floors, a gallery 3 m up all round it on columns, a stair to it; on the gallery, those who cast orbs. West,
# a round chapel: the repeater on its altar, and a hand on its wall that opens the closet behind it (armor).
# From the hall's south-east a stair goes down to the cellar, pillars and the blue key; a lift rises from it
# 6 m to the gallery. Off the east gallery, the blue door: the wing upstairs, the red key. The red door is
# the hall's north: past it, the way out and those who wait. Drawn as a plan (plans/level-2.plan, made by a
# script).
title The gatehouse
spawn 0 1 1
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.26
sky 5.0

